<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>OMNIX — Partenaires</title><style>
:root{--bg:#050914;--panel:rgba(11,18,33,.72);--line:rgba(148,163,184,.12);--text:#eef2ff;--muted:#94a3b8;--cyan:#67e8f9;--violet:#8b5cf6;--gold:#f5c451}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(99,102,241,.14),transparent 30%),radial-gradient(circle at 100% 30%,rgba(6,182,212,.09),transparent 28%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.site-shell{min-height:100vh;transition:margin-right .28s ease}.site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(3,7,18,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}.header-inner{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 28px));min-height:70px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center}.brand-logo{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06b6d4,#6366f1,#8b5cf6)}.brand-logo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.brand strong{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px}.brand small{display:block;color:#64748b;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.btn{min-height:40px;padding:0 13px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#cbd5e1;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(139,92,246,.35)}main{width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 28px));margin:auto;padding:62px 0 100px}.hero{text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid rgba(103,232,249,.16);border-radius:999px;color:var(--cyan);font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.4px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,54px);margin:17px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-1.8px}.hero p{max-width:730px;margin:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.banner{margin:0 0 24px;padding:15px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(103,232,249,.18);border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(6,182,212,.10),rgba(99,102,241,.10));text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.banner strong{color:var(--cyan)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.partner{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(15,23,42,.78),rgba(3,7,18,.74));box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.22);transition:.22s}.partner:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(103,232,249,.2)}.partner.featured{border-color:rgba(245,196,81,.42);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(245,196,81,.08),0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}.partner img{width:100%;height:190px;display:block;object-fit:cover;background:#0b1220}.body{padding:19px}.topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}.title{font-size:17px;font-weight:900}.crown{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(245,196,81,.11);border:1px solid rgba(245,196,81,.24);color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;font-weight:900}.desc{color:#9eacc0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.75;margin:10px 0 16px;white-space:pre-line}.discord{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:11px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(88,101,242,.15);border:1px solid rgba(88,101,242,.2);color:#c7d2fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:900}.empty{padding:40px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:18px;color:var(--muted);grid-column:1/-1}.pagination{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:7px;margin-top:24px}.page{min-width:36px;height:36px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);border-radius:10px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.page.active{background:rgba(99,102,241,.18);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(99,102,241,.3)}.rules{margin-top:50px;padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:rgba(10,17,30,.58)}.rules h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:18px}.rules p,.rules li{color:#9eacc0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}.rules ul{padding-left:19px}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions .back{display:none}.partner img{height:170px}}.omnix-sidebar-open .site-shell{margin-right:min(340px,92vw)}@media(max-width:850px){.omnix-sidebar-open .site-shell{margin-right:0}}
</style></head><body><div class="site-shell"><header class="site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-logo"><img src="/logo.png" alt="OMNIX"></span><span><strong>OMNIX</strong><small>Control Center</small></span></a><div class="actions"><a class="btn back" href="/">Accueil</a><a class="btn primary" href="/connexion">Connexion</a><button class="btn" type="button" onclick="openOmnixSidebar()">Menu</button></div></div></header><main><div class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">ÉCOSYSTÈME OMNIX</span><h1>Nos partenaires</h1><p>Découvrez les projets qui collaborent avec OMNIX et contribuent à faire grandir l’écosystème.</p></div><div class="banner"><strong>Deviens Partenaire</strong> et gagne un abonnement tout au long du partenariat !</div><section class="grid" id="partners"><div class="empty">Chargement des partenaires…</div></section><div class="pagination" id="pagination"></div><section class="rules"><h2>Consignes partenaires</h2><p>Le partenariat OMNIX repose sur une collaboration claire et durable.</p><ul><li>Publier le Discord et le site web officiel d’OMNIX lorsque cela est prévu dans le partenariat.</li><li>Présenter correctement le projet OMNIX et ses fonctionnalités, sans informations trompeuses.</li><li>Conserver une présentation professionnelle et respecter les utilisateurs des deux communautés.</li><li>Ne pas publier de contenu illégal, trompeur ou contraire aux règles des plateformes concernées.</li><li>Le partenariat peut être réévalué si les engagements convenus ne sont plus respectés.</li></ul></section></main></div><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><script>let all=[],page=1;const per=5;function esc(v){return String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,m=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[m]))}async function load(){try{const r=await fetch('/api/partners',{cache:'no-store'});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'Erreur');all=d.data||[];render()}catch(e){document.getElementById('partners').innerHTML='<div class="empty">Impossible de charger les partenaires.</div>'}}function render(){const pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(all.length/per));if(page>pages)page=pages;const start=(page-1)*per;const rows=all.slice(start,start+per);document.getElementById('partners').innerHTML=rows.map(p=>`<article class="partner ${p.featured?'featured':''}"><img src="${esc(p.imageUrl)}" alt="${esc(p.title)}" loading="lazy"><div class="body"><div class="topline"><div class="title">${esc(p.title)}</div>${p.featured?'<span class="crown">♛ FAVORI</span>':''}</div><div class="desc">${esc(p.description)}</div><a class="discord" href="${esc(p.discordUrl)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rejoindre le Discord</a></div></article>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">Aucun partenaire pour le moment.</div>';document.getElementById('pagination').innerHTML=pages>1?Array.from({length:pages},(_,i)=>`<button class="page ${i+1===page?'active':''}" onclick="page=${i+1};render()">${i+1}</button>`).join(''):''}load();</script></body></html>
